{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">恒生指數下跌逾200點，跌穿兩萬五。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">騰訊下跌半成，阿里巴巴和美團跌百分之2。資金炒作個別晶片股，壁仞升百分之6，瀾起升近一成三。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-22T07:31:30.374049+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":65,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}